ft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2026026017 7aStatistics.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf20140261812 aU.S. Census Bureau,eissuing body.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no200310060105tCurrent business reports. Service annual surveyg2011w(DLC) 86642553w(OCoLC)997778605tCurrent business reports. Service annual surveyg2011w(DLC) 2006230080w(OCoLC)7011365307tAnnual capital expenditures surveyw(DLC) 2026229190w(OCoLC)161891317607tAnnual retail trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229191w(OCoLC)161891842107tAnnual survey of manufacturersw(DLC) 2026229192w(OCoLC)161891892407tAnnual wholesale trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229193w(OCoLC)161892798707tManufacturers' unfilled orders (M3UFO) surveyw(DLC) 2026229194w(OCoLC)161893701307tReport of organizationw(DLC) 2026229195w(OCoLC)161893841607tAnnual integrated economic surveyw(DLC) 2026229189w(OCoLC)161893876140uhttps://purl.fdlp.gov/GPO/gpo260312704 zAddress at time of PURL creationuhttps://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/sas.html  aC0bGPO  abc72 20260928b20260928  aCONSERNEWb20260928  aUNREPORTEDPUBSASKGPOb20260928  aISSNREQb20260928  aVEND01b2026093003594cai a2200589 i 00147998120260928162249.0m     o  d        cr |||||||||||260928d20uu2025mduar w os   f0    2eng c  a2026229195  a(OCoLC)1618938416  aGPObengerdaepncGPOdGPO  apcc  an-us---  aXZLS  a0146 (online)0 aC 3.2:OR 3/00aReport of organization. 1a[Suitland, Md.] :bUnited States Census Bureau,c-2025.  a1 online resource  aUpdated irregularly  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aCeased in 2025.  aThis is a publication issued by the United States federal government or produced with federal funds.  aIn scope of the U.S. Government Publishing Office Cataloging and Indexing Program (C&I) and Federal Depository Library Program (FDLP).  aThe Report of Organization was used to update the Census Bureau's list of businesses and provides key source data for County Business Patterns and other statistical series. Formerly the Company Organization Survey, identified establishments of multi-unit firms, was used to update the Census Bureau's list of businesses, and provided key source data for County Business Patterns and other statistical series. This survey was taken primarily to assure full coverage and high quality of other statistical programs, and did not routinely provide data products for public use. Provided the only direct source of information on changes in multi-establishment company organization and industry classification at the establishment level.  aMerged with: Annual capital expenditures survey, Annual retail trade survey, Annual Survey of manufacturers, Annual wholesale trade survey, Manufacturers' unfilled orders survey, Service annual survey, to form: Annual integrated economic survey.0 aPage last revised - September 8, 2025; title from web page (viewed Sept. 24, 2026). 0aIndustrial surveyszUnited States. 0aIndustrial statisticszUnited States.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85140359 0aBusiness enterpriseszUnited StatesvStatistics. 7aSurveys.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2026026017 7aStatistics.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf20140261812 aU.S. Census Bureau,eissuing body.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no200310060107tAnnual capital expenditures surveyw(DLC) 2026229190w(OCoLC)161891317607tAnnual retail trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229191w(OCoLC)161891842107tAnnual survey of manufacturersw(DLC) 2026229192w(OCoLC)161891892407tAnnual wholesale trade surveyw(DLC) 2026229193w(OCoLC)161892798707tManufacturers' unfilled orders (M3UFO) surveyw(DLC) 2026229194w(OCoLC)161893701307tService annual surveyw(DLC) 2026229196w(OCoLC)161893874907tAnnual integrated economic surveyw(DLC) 2026229189w(OCoLC)161893876140uhttps://purl.fdlp.gov/GPO/gpo260295704 zAddres